    <briefdescription>
<para>Platform Port Interface for High-Resolution PWM &amp; Power Driver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines low-level target hardware binding for sub-nanosecond edge placement, complementary gate output pairs with dead-time insertion, phase shifting, and zero-latency hardware fault trip interlocks. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
